Title: VLOOKUP using AWK to append multiple values as new columns in CSV file.
Body: <p>I have two CSV files without headers that dont exceed 1 GB. For example:</p>
<p><strong>File1.csv</strong> with 4 columns:</p>
<pre><code>1,75.10,&quot;1&quot;,&quot;1&quot;
2,12.01,&quot;0&quot;,&quot;4&quot;
4,26.57,&quot;1&quot;,&quot;1&quot;
