Title: Miller: ofs=&quot;\n&quot;?.
Body: <p>Suppose I have:</p>
<pre><code>cat file
&quot;Field 1, Line 1&quot;,Field 2,&quot;Field 3, Line 1&quot;
&quot;Field 1, Line 2&quot;,Field 2,&quot;Field 3, Line 2&quot;
</code></pre>
<p>With Miller, I want to produce:</p>
