            &lt;groupId&gt;javax.xml.ws&lt;/groupId&gt;
            &lt;artifactId&gt;jaxws-api&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;2.1&lt;/version&gt;
        &lt;/dependency&gt;
        &lt;dependency&gt;
            &lt;groupId&gt;com.sun.xml.ws&lt;/groupId&gt;
            &lt;artifactId&gt;rt&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;4.0.1&lt;/version&gt;
        &lt;/dependency&gt;

        &lt;dependency&gt;
            &lt;groupId&gt;com.sun.xml.ws&lt;/groupId&gt;
            &lt;artifactId&gt;jaxws-rt&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;4.0.1&lt;/version&gt;
        &lt;/dependency&gt;
        &lt;dependency&gt;
            &lt;groupId&gt;jakarta.xml.ws&lt;/groupId&gt;
            &lt;artifactId&gt;jakarta.xml.ws-api&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;4.0.0&lt;/version&gt;
        &lt;/dependency&gt;
        &lt;dependency&gt;
            &lt;groupId&gt;WSIMPOTJAR&lt;/groupId&gt;
            &lt;artifactId&gt;WSIMPOTJAR&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;1.0&lt;/version&gt;
            &lt;scope&gt;provided&lt;/scope&gt;
        &lt;/dependency&gt;
        &lt;dependency&gt;
            &lt;groupId&gt;javax.xml.bind&lt;/groupId&gt;
            &lt;artifactId&gt;jaxb-api&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;2.3.1&lt;/version&gt;
        &lt;/dependency&gt;

        &lt;dependency&gt;
            &lt;groupId&gt;com.sun.xml.bind&lt;/groupId&gt;
            &lt;artifactId&gt;jaxb-impl&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;2.2.5-b10&lt;/version&gt;
        &lt;/dependency&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>PS: I have tried these solutions below but neither one of them worked.</p>
<ul>
<li><p><a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/75223619/jakarta-xml-ws-spi-provider-com-sun-xml-ws-spi-providerimpl-not-a-subtype">jakarta.xml.ws.spi.Provider: com.sun.xml.ws.spi.ProviderImpl not a subtype</a></p>
</li>
<li><p><a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/54032558/jdk-11-jax-ws-provider-com-sun-xml-internal-ws-spi-providerimpl-not-found">JDK 11; JAX-WS; Provider com.sun.xml.internal.ws.spi.ProviderImpl not found</a></p>
</li>
<li><p><a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/49107375/getting-java-lang-classnotfoundexception-com-sun-xml-internal-ws-spi-providerim">Getting java.lang.ClassNotFoundException: com.sun.xml.internal.ws.spi.ProviderImpl despite the dependencies are defined</a></p>
</li>
</ul>

Answers:
```python
from java.lang import ClassNotFoundException
from java.lang import ClassNotFoundException

def get_class_provider():
    try:
        # Try to load the class
        java.lang.Class.forName('com.sun.xml.ws.spi.ProviderImpl')
        return True
    except ClassNotFoundException:
        return False

def get_class_provider_jakarta():
    try:
        # Try to load the class
        java.lang.Class.forName('jakarta.xml.ws.spi.Provider')
        return True
    except ClassNotFoundException:
        return False

# Check if the class is found
if get_class_provider():
    print("Class ProviderImpl found")
else:
    print("Class ProviderImpl not found")

if get_class_provider_jakarta():
    print("Class Provider found")
else:
    print("Class Provider not found")
```

This Python script tries to load the `com.sun.xml.ws.spi.ProviderImpl` and `jakarta.xml.ws.spi.Provider` classes using Java's `Class.forName()` method. If the classes are found, it prints a message indicating that the class is found; otherwise, it prints a message indicating that the class is not found.

